OL,3,GNEWSAI just need my home back, says
OL,4,Adesperate mum living in 'rotten' flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says she just wants her home
OL,7,Fback after living in a "rotten" flat
OL,8,Ffor two years.
OL,10,FMelinda Ban and her teenage sons live
OL,11,Fin a block of flats in Llanishen,
OL,12,FCardiff, where a fire broke out in one
OL,13,Fof the apartments in 2024.
OL,15,FBan, 41, said her home suffered water
OL,16,Fdamage resulting in mould and damp.
OL,18,FShe owns her flat, but Cardiff council
OL,19,Fowns the lease, which means it's
OL,20,Fresponsible for the land and structure.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
